  "description": "BERT base cased encoder package for DemaConsulting.WordSense: an int8 ONNX bert-base-cased encoder composed with the built-in model of the core package. It scores the fine senses of the trained lemmas with weights embedded in the package and answers every other ambiguous word through the built-in statistical model. The roughly 104 MiB model is downloaded once on first use and verified by SHA-256.",
